WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:02.730
On an ultrawide, the edges go to waste.

2
00:00:03.800 --> 00:00:05.980
Moorings pins your apps to the edges.

3
00:00:07.300 --> 00:00:09.230
And keeps the middle clear for your work.

4
00:00:10.800 --> 00:00:12.870
Up to four apps, two on each side.

5
00:00:13.800 --> 00:00:16.090
Drag a window to an edge. Let go.

6
00:00:17.300 --> 00:00:18.590
Or snap it with a key.

7
00:00:20.300 --> 00:00:23.250
Halves, thirds, quarters, and sizes of your own.

8
00:00:23.800 --> 00:00:26.020
Hold a key and point, and it lands there.

9
00:00:27.300 --> 00:00:29.610
Save a layout. Plug in, and it comes back.

10
00:00:30.700 --> 00:00:33.820
No ultrawide? It anchors on your widest screen.

11
00:00:34.200 --> 00:00:35.940
One sailboat in the menu bar.

12
00:00:36.600 --> 00:00:39.010
Moorings. Free and open source for the Mac.

